# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# GAME DATA — never commit any of this.
#
# Ex Machina / Hard Truck Apocalypse assets remain the property of
# their respective rights holders. This repository is a tool for editing that data, not a
# place to redistribute it. The same applies to sample models used
# while reverse engineering a format: keep them locally, describe the
# measurements in the docs instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
